        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n\nONE BEDROOM APARTMENT IN DUBLIN 7\n\n\nRay Cooke Lettings is delighted to present this bright and spacious one-bedroom apartment to the market, ideally located on the ever-popular Prussia Street in the heart of Stoneybatter, Dublin 7.\n\nThe accommodation is filled with natural light and comprises of a kitchen/living area, one double bedroom, and a bathroom. The apartment is positioned on the ground floor with a rear patio.\n\nThis superb property enjoys an unbeatable location, just moments from the LUAS Stop on the Red Line, providing excellent access to the city centre and beyond. Stoneybatter is one of Dublin's most vibrant neighbourhoods, offering an array of cafés, bars, restaurants, shops, parks, and leisure facilities.\n \n<u>Key Features:</u>\n<ul>\n <li>Spacious living accommodation</li>\n <li>Short walk to the Luas</li>\n <li>Bus routes at your doorstep</li>\n <li>LOCATION, LOCATION, LOCATION</li>\n</ul>\n\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE\n"
